1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,219
FailSafe 6.0.13 adds a simple path from
your development Console to Statewright.

2
00:00:07,457 --> 00:00:12,428
Open FailSafe in VS Code, and launch
the Console from the Command Palette.

3
00:00:22,293 --> 00:00:24,782
Select Integrations, then Catalog.

4
00:00:25,481 --> 00:00:30,820
Here you'll find Statewright AI,
clearly labeled as a website handoff.

5
00:00:33,892 --> 00:00:38,898
Select Open Statewright Run History,
and Statewright opens in your browser.

6
00:00:39,846 --> 00:00:43,488
Statewright handles sign-in and
run history on its own site.

7
00:00:44,148 --> 00:00:48,167
FailSafe does not import that
history or enforce those workflows.

8
00:00:48,872 --> 00:00:51,697
This card is a link, not a connection.

9
00:00:53,388 --> 00:00:56,424
Open Statewright run
history from FailSafe.

10
00:00:57,087 --> 00:01:00,937
Version 6.0.13 is available now.
